      "internal": false,
      "mergeID": "5b7d5808141c6f6ef89dfd7d",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Given the same trigger abilities as world triggers have (OnInteract/Local, OnTriggerEnter, SetGameObjectActive/Trigger Audio, etc) but on avatars, it would allow for a ton more abilities for avatars than just the 5 gestures. Programming swords OnHit to trigger a noise, programming an invisible button OnInteract on the neck to (setgameobjectactive) take on or off a helmet or head prop, theres endless possibilities. Please let this happen.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Triggers on Avatars",
      "pinned": false,
      "postID": "5b1a4a5400d803221bcfca53",
