  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-06-08T09:20:20.152Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Rather than blocking most triggers on avatars just allow users to enable or disable the ability to be affected by certain triggers like colliders or \"pick up\" triggers.\n\nSo far, people have found ways to pick up other players to annoy them. This would stop trolls from abusing this feature as it can be disabled locally.\n\nThis would also enable avatar creators to use these triggers to create avatars with more cool features, like a giant being able to pick up and throw players or players being able to climb into the cockpit of a titan.\n\n(Gif source: https://gfycat.com/eagerbriefbighorn)",
